  "solution": "$\\dfrac{1}{f} = (\\mu - 1)\\left(\\dfrac{1}{R_1} - \\dfrac{1}{R_2}\\right) = 0.5\\left(\\dfrac{1}{20} + \\dfrac{1}{30}\\right) = \\dfrac{1}{24}$, so $f = 24$ cm.",
